press start
press z
press start
press down
wait 0.6
shot cycle_iso_north
wait 0.1
shot cycle_iso_north_2
press right
wait 0.5
shot cycle_iso_east
press right
wait 0.5
shot cycle_iso_south
press right
wait 0.5
shot cycle_iso_west
